{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261112%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1430　27庭　法官陳廣池<br/>5男涉「非法操練」串謀顛覆國家政權　2男提訊｜提訊<br/>► 0930　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>廉署火網行動搗圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸沙田法院<br/>► 0930　7庭　裁判官黃國輝<br/>雙程證男涉使用假泰國學歷被控｜開審<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭紀航<br/>六旬男子涉城巴上以飛機杯搖晃下體｜審前覆核</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　4庭　裁判官曾宗堯<br/>涉九龍城廣場襲擊他人　中科監察主席潘焯鴻被控｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>女舞台劇《關於那隻龜回魂的故事》演出期間　觀眾席上男子涉襲擊女子｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 1430　7庭　暫委裁判官李卓慧<br/>光榮冰室九龍灣店涉無牌經營｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T13:38:57.029114+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":443,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T13:17:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T22:58:59.619475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T13:32:15.794091+00:00","content_hash":"457418a9eb35ffc8ea7e3c9ecab5a2efcde4ae1073b93df8800595286c160a07","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}